                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Numva ijwi risa n'iry'abantu benshi n'irisa n'iry'amazi menshi asuma, n'irisa n'iryo guhinda kw'inkuba gukomeye kwinshi rivuga riti “Haleluya! Kuko Umwami Imana yacu Ishoborabyose iri ku ngoma! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunezerwe twishime, tuyihimbaze, kuko ubukwe bw'Umwana w'Intama busohoye umugeni we akaba yiteguye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ahawe kwambara umwenda w'igitare mwiza, urabagirana utanduye.” (Uwo mwenda w'igitare mwiza ni wo mirimo yo gukiranuka y'abera.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
